╭─ Patch Generation ─────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ To address the issue where JSONField values are displayed as       │
│ invalid JSON when readonly in the Django admin, we need to modify  │
│ the display_for_field function in django/contrib/admin/utils.py.   │
│ The current implementation directly uses json.dumps to serialize   │
│ the value, which can lead to invalid JSON when the field is        │
│ read-only. Instead, we should call the prepare_value method of the │
│ JSONField to ensure proper serialization.                          │
